{"id": "sfmta-overtime-slips-and-operator-settlement", "title": "Missing Muni overtime slips and the $8 million operator settlement", "seconds": 56.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.12, "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "1cf60fe8dd8e8bff", "words": 149, "beats": [{"scene": "slips", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors looked at one July 2012 pay period across three Muni divisions.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.92, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Could", "Muni", "verify", "the", "overtime?"], "sub": "San Francisco transit employees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.78, 0.89, 1.13, 1.52, 1.79, 2.19, 2.43, 3.04, 3.46, 3.81, 4.13]}, {"scene": "slips", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They could not verify 1,079 of 2,448 entries for unscheduled overtime.", "t0": 5.04, "t1": 11.69, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1,079 of 2,448", "label": "Sampled unscheduled overtime entries without supporting slips"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.59, 1.14, 1.41, 1.9, 2.88, 3.06, 3.29, 3.71, 3.93, 4.2, 4.71, 5.41, 5.61, 6.13]}, {"scene": "slips", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Dispatchers could enter time and approve it. One division discarded slips after several pay periods.", "t0": 11.81, "t1": 17.3, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller", "text": "Overtime approvals", "mark": "Overtime approvals"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.58, 0.78, 1.05, 1.4, 1.5, 1.82, 2.48, 2.74, 3.15, 3.62, 4.15, 4.45, 4.8, 5.01]}, {"scene": "slips", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Separately, five operators received duplicate birthday pay totaling $1,181.", "t0": 17.42, "t1": 24.37, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Controller review", "heading": "What the Controller identified", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "Duplicate birthday pay", "value": "$1,181"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Expert premiums (at least)", "value": "$280"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 1.14, 1.5, 2.0, 2.39, 2.86, 3.26, 3.86, 4.32, 4.62, 5.15, 5.4, 5.87, 6.39]}, {"scene": "slips", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "At least 280 dollars went to 13 operators outside the expert premium eligibility list.", "t0": 24.49, "t1": 30.32, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Expert premiums"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.42, 0.65, 0.99, 1.2, 1.72, 1.92, 2.04, 2.5, 3.33, 3.87, 4.0, 4.38, 4.84, 5.47]}, {"scene": "lawsuit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Operators later said they had worked time the agency had not counted for pay.", "t0": 30.54, "t1": 34.81, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "notice", "kicker": "U.S. District Court, Northern District of California", "text": "Operator wage claims", "mark": "Operator wage claims"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.85, 1.1, 1.25, 1.4, 1.69, 2.38, 2.57, 3.02, 3.19, 3.43, 3.77, 3.92]}, {"scene": "lawsuit", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2017, the board approved an eight million dollar settlement.", "t0": 34.93, "t1": 38.96, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8 million", "label": "Operator wage settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 1.51, 1.66, 1.97, 2.51, 2.73, 3.0, 3.35, 3.65]}, {"scene": "lawsuit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The settlement required drop boxes for overtime cards. Operators still had to request the time.", "t0": 39.08, "t1": 44.81, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "SFMTA Board of Directors", "text": "Overtime cards", "mark": "Overtime cards"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.65, 1.1, 1.4, 1.83, 1.99, 2.45, 3.46, 3.99, 4.25, 4.36, 4.45, 5.09, 5.26]}, {"scene": "lawsuit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The federal court granted final approval in July 2017.", "t0": 44.93, "t1": 48.44, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "court", "kicker": "U.S. District Court, RECAP docket copy", "text": "July 2017 final approval", "mark": "July 2017 final approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.77, 1.17, 1.54, 1.96, 2.06, 2.5, 2.81]}, {"scene": "lawsuit", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not connect individual wage claims to specific entries in the audit sample.", "t0": 48.56, "t1": 53.14, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Individual transactions", "Amount paid to operators"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.62, 0.78, 0.95, 1.35, 1.88, 2.17, 2.54, 2.66, 3.16, 3.63, 3.77, 3.89, 4.16]}, {"scene": "lawsuit", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 53.26, "t1": 55.62, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.82, 0.99, 1.26, 1.33, 1.43, 1.66, 1.93]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"slips": "How were hours documented?", "lawsuit": "What did the operators claim?"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "question"}